* Component definitions
M3 3 6 7 PMOS
M1 8 5 5 NMOS
M5h 4 5 2 NMOS
VIC 5 0 DC
VCMC 2 0 DC
CLC 4 7

* Connections
* PMOS M3: Drain(3) Gate(6) Source(7)
* NMOS M1: Drain(8) Gate(5) Source(5)
* NMOS M5h: Drain(4) Gate(5) Source(2)
* Voltage Source VIC connects to net 5
* Voltage Source VCMC connects to net 2
* Capacitor CLC connects between net 4 and net 7